        "i.MX RT1062. Lógica de 3.3 V; NO tolerante a 5 V. ADC leído a 10 bits (hardware 12 bits), PWM de 8 bits por defecto. LED integrado pin 13. Probada en hardware con RobotBlocks.": "i.MX RT1062. 3.3 V logic; NOT 5 V tolerant. ADC read at 10 bits (12-bit hardware), 8-bit PWM by default. Built-in LED on pin 13. Tested on hardware with RobotBlocks.",
        "i.MX RT1062. Lógica de 3.3 V; NO tolerante a 5 V. ADC leído a 10 bits (hardware 12 bits), PWM de 8 bits por defecto. LED integrado pin 13.": "i.MX RT1062. 3.3 V logic; NOT 5 V tolerant. ADC read at 10 bits (12-bit hardware), 8-bit PWM by default. Built-in LED on pin 13.",
        "PWM por defecto: 4482 Hz (aprox.).": "Default PWM: 4482 Hz (approx.).",
        "PWM por defecto: 3611 Hz (aprox.).": "Default PWM: 3611 Hz (approx.).",
        "LED integrado; alto enciende, bajo apaga. No usar INPUT_PULLUP; comparte SPI SCK. PWM por defecto: 3611 Hz (aprox.).": "Built-in LED; high turns it on, low turns it off. Do not use INPUT_PULLUP; shared with SPI SCK. Default PWM: 3611 Hz (approx.).",
        "I2C Wire: SDA. PWM por defecto: 3611 Hz (aprox.).": "I2C Wire: SDA. Default PWM: 3611 Hz (approx.).",
        "I2C Wire: SCL. PWM por defecto: 3611 Hz (aprox.).": "I2C Wire: SCL. Default PWM: 3611 Hz (approx.).",
        "pad inferior, requiere soldar. PWM por defecto: 4482 Hz (aprox.).": "underside pad, soldering required. Default PWM: 4482 Hz (approx.).",
        "pad inferior, requiere soldar.": "underside pad, soldering required.",
        "pad inferior, requiere soldar. Compartido con SDIO; no usar como GPIO con SDIO activo. PWM por defecto: 4482 Hz (aprox.).": "underside pad, soldering required. Shared with SDIO; do not use as GPIO with SDIO active. Default PWM: 4482 Hz (approx.)."
